 "card": "We gave 1 AI model PayPal's refund tool and changed only the shop's instructions. Each model ran each test case once, and every refund call it made was replayed unchanged through Owed's gate. Adversarial test cases (5 per setting, $5 owed) where the AI alone paid more than was owed: 4 with no policy ($80.00), 1 with a typical shop prompt ($20.00), 0 with our strictest prompt ($0.00). The same calls through Owed's gate: 0, 0, 0. Legitimate test cases (5 per setting) paid in full by the AI alone: 3 with no policy, 5 with a typical shop prompt, 5 with our strictest prompt. Through the gate alone: 3, 5, 5. With Owed's recovery step as well: 5, 5, 5.",
